sequenceDiagram
    participant Driver as Driver Mobile
    participant Transport as Transport Service
    participant GPS as GPS/VTS Provider
    participant Operations as Operations Service
    participant QC as QC Service
    participant Costing as Trip Costing Service
    participant EventBus as Event Bus

    Note over Transport: Trip Created & Assigned

    Driver->>Transport: Start Trip
    Transport->>Transport: Update Status (IN_TRANSIT)
    Transport->>EventBus: Publish TripStarted
    Transport->>Driver: Return Trip Details

    loop Every 60 seconds
        Driver->>GPS: Update Location
        GPS->>Transport: Location Update
        Transport->>EventBus: Publish TripLocationUpdated
    end

    Driver->>Operations: Gate In (Origin)
    Operations->>Operations: Record Gate Entry
    Operations->>EventBus: Publish GateInCompleted
    EventBus->>Operations: Trigger Weighing

    Operations->>Operations: Weigh Empty Vehicle
    Operations->>EventBus: Publish WeighingCompleted (Empty)

    Operations->>Operations: Load Products
    Operations->>EventBus: Publish LoadingCompleted

    Operations->>Operations: Weigh Loaded Vehicle
    Operations->>EventBus: Publish WeighingCompleted (Loaded)

    Operations->>Operations: Gate Out (Origin)
    Operations->>EventBus: Publish GateOutCompleted

    Note over Driver: Trip in Transit

    Driver->>Operations: Gate In (Destination)
    Operations->>EventBus: Publish GateInCompleted

    Operations->>Operations: Unload Products
    Operations->>EventBus: Publish UnloadingCompleted
    EventBus->>QC: Trigger QC Inspection

    QC->>QC: Create QC Inspection
    QC->>QC: Perform Physical Inspection
    QC->>QC: Collect Samples (if needed)
    QC->>QC: Complete Inspection
    QC->>EventBus: Publish QCInspectionCompleted
    EventBus->>Transport: Update Trip Status

    Operations->>Operations: Gate Out (Destination)
    Operations->>EventBus: Publish GateOutCompleted

    Driver->>Transport: Complete Trip
    Transport->>Transport: Update Status (COMPLETED)
    Transport->>EventBus: Publish TripCompleted
    EventBus->>Costing: Trigger Cost Calculation

    Costing->>Costing: Calculate Trip Cost
    Costing->>EventBus: Publish TripCostCalculated
    Costing->>Transport: Return Cost Details

